OL,3,GNEWSATighter security for bonfire after
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra security will be put in place at
OL,7,Fa bonfire and fireworks display after a
OL,8,Fstabbing there in 2025.
OL,10,FOrganisers of the Donnington Bonfire in
OL,11,FTelford said they were "devastated"
OL,12,Fafter a 20-year-old man was attacked
OL,13,Fand injured shortly after the bonfire
OL,14,Fwas lit on 8 November.
OL,16,FAbubakar Saleem, 22, of Victoria
OL,17,FAvenue, Wellington in Telford, pleaded
OL,18,Fguilty to wounding with intent and
OL,19,Fhaving a bladed article on 24 August
OL,20,Fand will be sentenced at Stoke-on-Trent
OL,21,FCrown Court in October.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
