OL,3,GNEWSATighter security for bonfire after
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media
OL,7,Forganisers said visitors to the 2026
OL,8,Fevent would "see enhanced security and
OL,9,Fentry procedures, together with
OL,10,Fstrengthened arrangements for crowd
OL,11,Fmanagement and emergency response".
